{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmxWDRqEWxjgx5FugphS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll tell my son I didn't decide anything and I want to talk it over with him first. The page puts \"פסגות\" at the top of its list as \"הזול\" (the cheapest). On screen 3 the fund it seems to be calculating with is \"אי.בי.אי. מחקה ת\"א 125 (4A)\". It says I'd be left with **86,045 ₪** after 10 years. That's from 10,000 ₪ at the start plus 500 ₪ a month, which is 70,000 ₪ put in. I'm not sure about any of it. I've never heard of Psagot, it isn't my bank, and the page uses words I don't know.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n- **Screen 1:** The title says \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\". I know מדד from the news as prices, not shares. There were buttons in English letters, MSCI and S&P. I nearly left, but I came for the 125, and \"ת\"א-125\" was already chosen. It says it's the 125 biggest companies in Tel Aviv and \"בשקלים\". Then there were boxes: \"סכום היום\" 10,000 and \"הפקדה חודשית\" 500, each with a slider under it. I didn't touch the sliders.\n- **Screen 2:** \"תשואה בשנה\" 7%. Is that promised? It doesn't say. There was a button \"אינפלציה\" and \"בכסף של היום\". I don't know if I pressed it or what it means for the number. Then the big numbers: I put in 70,000 ₪, and the box says \"נשאר לכם בעוד 10 שנים... 86,045 ₪\". Next to it a second box, 85,015 ₪, with \"−1,030\". The minus put me off that one. Then a bar of colours with 5,555 on it.\n- **Screen 3:** A legend of fees: \"דמי משמרת\", \"דמי ניהול חשבון\", \"דמי ניהול הקרן\", \"מס\". The colours are too close for me to match them to the bar. Then \"פסגות ניירות ערך בע\"מ\", and \"מה החשבון גובה ב־10 שנים: 1,049 ₪\". At the bottom was the fund name, half covered by a round arrow button.\n- **Screens 4–6:** A long list of banks and companies, with lots of numbers.\n  - Psagot is first, 86,045.\n  - לאומי gets 82,968, with 4,506 ₪ in fees. Hapoalim gets 81,052, with 6,530.\n  - Discount and Mercantile get 79,491, with 8,266. IBI gets 78,204.\n  - The ones at the bottom, Altshuler Trade, Excellence and Meitav Trade, go down to about 63,000, with more than 23,000 in fees.\n  - So yes, the banks take more: thousands of shekels in ten years.\n  - Under Hapoalim it says \"לנשים מגיל 60 וגברים מגיל 65 (סגור למצטרפים)\". Maybe there was a cheaper price for people my age, but it's closed to new people.\n- **Where I stopped:** After screen 6, with \"אינטראקטיב ישראל\" and \"Interactive Brokers\" marked \"אין נתון\". I was tired and anxious from all the numbers.\n\n**What I didn't understand**\n- \"4A\".\n- \"דמי משמרת\".\n- \"בכסף של היום\": is 86,045 what I'd really have, or something else?\n- The 7%: is it guaranteed?\n- \"לא בחישוב\" next to every bank.\n- The purple dotted lines under the numbers. I didn't click them.\n- \"חשבון ניירות ערך\": do I need to open a new account somewhere?\n- The small grey text above the list and the grey text in the boxes were hard to read.\n\n**What worried me**\n- Psagot is a name I don't know, and I wouldn't give them money without asking.\n- The whole thing is shares, not a deposit, so this money can go down.\n- I didn't see who is behind the page itself, \"מקור\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1933,"cache_read_input_tokens":13382,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1933},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f2275e92-f000-40f7-b09b-adf16cb10bc7","uuid":"c5782660-6faa-4ac2-8bec-e9f7fb5c00c8","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:04:08.890Z","request_id":"req_011CgmxWDBTn1ZHT8BDpzkku"}
